text It's the highway express.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ah.
sound R4J.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text To Kyushu.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ah.
sound R4K.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Doesn't that make you kind of uneasy?
text @[Tomoya]
text No, not really.
