text Please think about it a little.
text @[Tomoya]
text Wait, don't tell me...
sound R4M.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes. It's possible Dad is on that bus.
text @[Tomoya]
text That'd be way too much of a coincidence.
sound R4N.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text You can't be sure of that.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well... yeah, I can't be sure, but...
sound R4O.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text So Sanae-san doesn't know yet?
sound R4P.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text No... I haven't told her the details yet.
text @[Tomoya]
text That so...
text @[Tomoya]
text So you've been watching this entire time in place of Sanae-san, so she wouldn't get worried.
sound R4Q.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That's right...
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
