text Together, we continue looking at the images transmitted from the helicopter.
text New information keeps coming in one after another from the people that were dropped off from the bus.
text How the criminal had been a single young man.
text How he'd threatened the driver with a knife to make him move the bus.
text And how one man was stabbed with that knife, and had suffered an injury.
text Apparently he got stabbed because he kept persistently trying to persuade him to give it all up.
text ...It's Akio-san.
text Everyone in the room is thinking the same thing.
text There's no way that guy would just stay still in that situation.
text His sense of justice backfired.
text Apparently, the criminal also refused to let the nurses get on the bus to treat him.
text But how bad a wound is it?
text If they just slashed at him to intimidate him, it's probably fine.
text But if he were stabbed seriously, and continued losing blood without being able to stop it...
text ...then it would be just a matter of time before...
text Aah, only bad things are coming to mind.
text It must be the same for Sanae-san.
text She watches the TV intently, her hands clenched together as if in prayer.
text Once again, the bus stops at a service area to let off passengers.
text The image is so small that I can't really see what's happening.
text There are quite a few people being let off.
text There are young men mixed in this time too.
text And the familiar face of the old man...
text ...holding a cigarette in his mouth, always looking as if he's about to complain about something...
text ...isn't there.
text The door closes.
text Once again, the bus drives off.
text After that, the same thing continues.
text If he'd gotten off the bus just now, we should have gotten a phone call right away telling us that he's safe.
text However... one didn't come.
text And again, we get new information from the people that were dropped off.
text The only people left inside the bus right now were the bus driver, the criminal, and the man who suffered an injury.
text And when the man was stabbed during his attempt to persuade the criminal, it was in the abdomen.
text And he didn't even dodge it. After he was stabbed, he just continued trying to persuade the criminal with a smile as the sweat poured from his forehead.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Agh... that's something I could see the old man doing...)
text Due to the man's persuasions, he managed to get all the passengers let off the bus.
text In exchange, he ended up remaining on it, along with the bus driver.
text Even while suffering from a grave injury.
